WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Again. You know, so it's... For a while.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.400
And I wasn't happy.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.400
I wasn't that happy. And then...

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.350
I had my family, and I got happy.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.400
And now all I want to do is be funny
again.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.550
You know, so it's... You were always
funny.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.650
It's a freaking blast. It's just like...

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.850
That's why I said yes. I'm like, I want
to go fucking be funny

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.962
in front of a crowd. And that's beyond
it.
